      "content": "i know, i know. people keep saying there's help. but what does a counselor change? it doesn't make him less sick and it doesn't make me feel less empty. it just feels like i'm performing being alive. sometimes i look at him and i just think... if i could just be with him, in that quiet place where nothing hurts anymore, wouldn't that be better than this constant, agonizing waiting? it feels like the only way to actually find peace is to just stop fighting the inevitable.",
